--TEST--
PHP 8.5's `|>` — a right side with no `$_` — is refused with `E0129`, and because a pipeline is substitution rather than a node, the piped value never reaches the tree and so is never coloured — `rule:expressions/pipeline-substitution`, `rule:ide/rejected-syntax-gets-no-colour`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Real {}
var $n = 1;
var $r = $n |> $n;
var $b = 2;
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens
--EXPECT--
2:7+4 class
3:5+2 variable
4:5+2 variable
4:16+2 variable
5:5+2 variable
